[23.183131, "o", "+-------------+----------+---------+-----------------------------------+------------------------------+\r\n| code        | run_once | scope   | description                       | class                        |\r\n+=====================================================================================================+\r\n| extra_byte  | true     | header  | extra byte found due to paddin... | ExtraByteValidator           |\r\n| col_spell   | false    | columns | column spelled wrong              | ColumnNameValidator          |\r\n| binary      | false    | columns | binary data found in table val... | BinaryColDataValidator       |\r\n| empty       | false    | columns | empty values found                | EmptyColDataValidator        |\r\n| duplicate   | false    | data    | dulicate entries in data          | DuplicateValueValidator      |\r\n| zeros       | false    | data    | leading zeros in digit like so... | LeadingZerosValidator        |\r\n| anmap       | false    | columns | antenna mapping wrong             | AntennaNameMappingValidator  |\r\n| multifreqid | false    | data    | multiple freqid present           | MultipleFrequencyIdValidator |\r\n| date        | false    | header  | date format wrong                 | HeaderDateValidator          |\r\n| primary     | true     | header  | primary header check for fitsi... | HeaderPrimaryValidator       |\r\n+-------------+----------+---------+-----------------------------------+------------------------------+\r\n"]
